---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title="Schema (JSON-LD) Validator Lab | Waseem's SEO Guide">
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <ol>
      <li><a href={`${base}/`}>Home</a></li>
      <li><a href={`${base}/labs`}>Labs</a></li>
      <li aria-current="page">Schema Validator</li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <header>
    <span class="badge">📊 LAB 2</span>
    <h1>Schema (JSON-LD) Validator</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Paste any JSON-LD block. Get instant syntax validation, required-field checks for the most common Schema.org types, and a preview of what rich results Google could show.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="presets">
    <h3>📋 Start from a template:</h3>
    <div class="preset-row">
      <button data-preset="article" type="button">📰 Article</button>
      <button data-preset="person" type="button">👤 Person</button>
      <button data-preset="organization" type="button">🏢 Organization</button>
      <button data-preset="localbusiness" type="button">📍 LocalBusiness</button>
      <button data-preset="faqpage" type="button">❓ FAQPage</button>
      <button data-preset="howto" type="button">🛠️ HowTo</button>
      <button data-preset="product" type="button">🛒 Product</button>
      <button data-preset="recipe" type="button">🍳 Recipe</button>
      <button data-preset="video" type="button">🎬 VideoObject</button>
      <button data-preset="event" type="button">🎫 Event</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lab-tool">
    <div class="input-pane">
      <label for="jsonInput" class="input-label">
        Paste your JSON-LD here:
        <span class="hint">(content between <code>&lt;script type="application/ld+json"&gt;</code> tags)</span>
      </label>
      <textarea
        id="jsonInput"
        rows="20"
        spellcheck="false"
        placeholder="Paste JSON-LD..."
      ></textarea>
      <div class="actions">
        <button id="copyBtn" type="button" class="btn-secondary">📋 Copy</button>
        <button id="clearBtn" type="button" class="btn-ghost">🗑️ Clear</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="results-pane">
      <h3>✅ Validation results</h3>
      <div id="results">
        <p class="placeholder">Paste JSON-LD or click a template above to begin.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="rich-results-section" id="richSection" style="display:none">
    <h3>🌟 Likely rich-result eligibility</h3>
    <p>Based on the @type and required fields detected, this content may be eligible for:</p>
    <div id="richEligibility"></div>
    <p class="note">⚠️ Eligibility is a necessary but not sufficient condition. Google still applies quality + E-E-A-T thresholds. Test the final page with the <a href="https://search.google.com/test/rich-results" target="_blank" rel="noopener">official Google Rich Results Test</a> before relying on rich results.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="advice">
    <h2>📚 Why JSON-LD (and not microdata / RDFa)?</h2>
    <p>Google explicitly <a href="https://developers.google.com/search/docs/appearance/structured-data/intro-structured-data" target="_blank" rel="noopener">prefers JSON-LD</a>: it sits separately in <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> tags, doesn't interfere with rendering, and is easier to maintain. All examples in this course use JSON-LD.</p>
    <h3>Required vs. recommended fields</h3>
    <p>Google distinguishes between <strong>required</strong> properties (without them, you're ineligible for the rich result) and <strong>recommended</strong> properties (which improve appearance and CTR). This tool checks both, color-coded.</p>
  </section>

  <nav class="level-nav">
    <a href={`${base}/labs/title-tag-tester`} class="nav-btn">← Title Tag Tester</a>
    <a href={`${base}/labs/robots-txt-simulator`} class="nav-btn">Next: robots.txt Simulator →</a>
  </nav>
</Layout>

<style>
  .breadcrumbs { margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .breadcrumbs ol { display: flex; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .breadcrumbs li { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .breadcrumbs li:not(:last-child)::after { content: '→'; margin-left: 8px; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .breadcrumbs a { color: var(--color-link); text-decoration: none; }

  header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb 0%, #f5576c 100%);
    color: white;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    border-radius: 25px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  header h1 { font-size: 2.4em; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--color-text); }
  .subtitle { font-size: 1.15em; color: var(--color-text-secondary); max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.6; }

  .presets { margin: 30px 0; }
  .presets h3 { margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--color-text); }
  .preset-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .preset-row button {
    padding: 8px 16px;
    background: var(--color-surface-elevated);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.95em;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .preset-row button:hover {
    background: var(--color-brand-primary);
    color: white;
    border-color: var(--color-brand-primary);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .lab-tool {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .lab-tool { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .input-pane, .results-pane {
    background: var(--color-surface-elevated);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .input-label {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .hint { font-weight: 400; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9em; }

  textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: 'Monaco', 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    line-height: 1.5;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    resize: vertical;
  }
  textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--color-brand-primary); }

  .actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .btn-secondary, .btn-ghost {
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: none;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-secondary { background: var(--color-brand-primary); color: white; }
  .btn-secondary:hover { background: var(--color-brand-secondary); }
  .btn-ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--color-text-muted); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--color-surface); color: var(--color-text); }

  .results-pane h3 { margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--color-text); }
  .placeholder { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-style: italic; }

  .result-line {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-size: 0.95em;
  }
  .result-line.ok { background: rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.1); color: var(--color-success); border-left: 3px solid var(--color-success); }
  .result-line.warn { background: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.12); color: #856404; border-left: 3px solid var(--color-warning); }
  .result-line.error { background: rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.1); color: var(--color-error); border-left: 3px solid var(--color-error); }
  .result-line.info { background: rgba(23, 162, 184, 0.1); color: #0c5460; border-left: 3px solid var(--color-info); }
  .result-line code { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.05); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-family: monospace; }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .result-line.ok { color: #5dd879; background: rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.15); }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .result-line.warn { color: #ffd54f; background: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.15); }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .result-line.error { color: #ff8a80; background: rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.15); }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .result-line.info { color: #80deea; background: rgba(23, 162, 184, 0.15); }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .result-line code { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }

  .rich-results-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3e0 0%, #ffe0b2 100%);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  .rich-results-section h3 { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #e65100; }
  .rich-results-section .note { font-size: 0.9em; color: #e65100; margin-top: 16px; font-style: italic; }
  .rich-results-section a { color: var(--color-link); font-weight: 600; }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .rich-results-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3a2a1a 0%, #4a3a2a 100%);
  }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .rich-results-section h3,
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .rich-results-section .note { color: #ffcc80; }

  .rich-eligibility-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    margin: 10px 0;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-brand-primary);
  }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .rich-eligibility-card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); color: var(--color-text); }

  .advice h2 { color: var(--color-text); margin: 20px 0; }
  .advice h3 { color: var(--color-brand-primary); margin: 18px 0 8px; }
  .advice p { color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; }
  .advice code { background: var(--color-surface-elevated); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; color: var(--color-brand-primary); }
  .advice a { color: var(--color-link); font-weight: 600; }

  .level-nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 50px;
    padding-top: 30px;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--color-border-light);
  }
  .level-nav .nav-btn {
    padding: 12px 24px;
    background: var(--color-brand-gradient);
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    header h1 { font-size: 1.8em; }
    .level-nav { flex-direction: column; }
    .level-nav .nav-btn { width: 100%; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>

